# Release check for tiny-uv-lib

Dependencies are installed with `uv sync` and the tests run with `uv run pytest`.
See the [testing guide](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-uv-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
